{"id":"steam-1351740","steam":1351740,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Maximum Aura","summary":"Farm aura. Bonk googly-eyed NPCs to a phonk beat. Do not get cooked. A frantic top-down arcade survival shooter: auto-fire, dash through crowds, stack ridiculous upgrades, and unleash BRAINROT MODE when your aura bar is full.","about":"Maximum Aura is a fast, loud, neon top-down arcade shooter. Your gun fires on its own — you move, aim, dash, and try to survive an ever-growing swarm of googly-eyed NPCs for as long as you can.\r\n\r\n\nPick your character\n\r\n\n\r\n• Lil Aura — balanced. Shades on. Aura on.\r\n• The Rizzler — starts with 2 fidget spinners and a magnet, but a weaker gun.\r\n• Sigma — shotgun + big back, 140 HP, slow.\r\n• Goblin Mode — zoomies and dash spam, only 70 HP.\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\nLevel up and build something stupid\n\r\nCollect gems to level up and choose one of three upgrade cards each time: SIGMA GRINDSET, OHIO SHOTGUN, RICOCHET RIZZ, BUSSIN BOMBS, RENT FREE spinners, ZAP ZAP chain lightning, DELULU ZONE, GOOFY AHH BOOMERANG, FANUM TAX, CRASHOUT and more. Combine the right pair and they evolve into upgrades like GIGACHAD GATLING, OHIO CARPET BOMB, FIDGET BLENDER, THUNDER RIZZ and PLOT ARMOR.\r\n\r\n\nDash, combo, go BRAINROT MODE\n\r\nDash through enemies to bonk them — dash kills refund your cooldown. Chain kills to build your combo and multiply your aura. Fill the aura bar and trigger BRAINROT MODE for a screen-clearing rampage.\r\n\r\n\nBosses and hordes\n\r\nSurvive hordes, elites, exploding bombers, spitters, chonks and doomscrollers, chase the rare golden enemy, and take on bosses like THE UNC, GRANDUNC, THE LANDLORD, FINAL DOOMSCROLL and THE ALGORITHM.\r\n\r\n\nGet ranked, run it back\n\r\nEvery run ends with your aura farmed, survival time, NPCs bonked, max combo, level, dash kills and a rank. Your personal best is saved locally.\r\n\r\n\nFeatures\n\r\n\n\r\n• Short, replayable arcade runs\r\n• 4 playable characters with different starting builds\r\n• 19 upgrades plus 7 evolved combo upgrades\r\n• Screen-clearing BRAINROT MODE ultimate\r\n• Rotating bosses with different attack patterns\r\n• Procedural music and sound effects that ramp up with the action\r\n• Keyboard + mouse and gamepad support\r\n• Toggle FX (flashing and screen shake) for a calmer \"chill mode\", and a sound toggle\r\n\n\r\n\r\nPHOTOSENSITIVE SEIZURE WARNING: This game contains flashing lights, bright full-screen flashes and screen shake that may trigger seizures in people with photosensitive epilepsy. A reduced-flashing mode is available on launch and anytime via the in-game FX toggle.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351740/5df28255bdfe282dd3989252a0e903494263d5e8/library_capsule.jpg?t=1793050404","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351740/10280f861c84b224355fa9c37687342be8e022d8/header.jpg?t=1793050404","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351740/d219db42ae62b3f67ef7069273482cb24fed0e7c/library_hero.jpg?t=1793050404","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351740/10280f861c84b224355fa9c37687342be8e022d8/header.jpg?t=1793050404","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351740/716145875ccc60b5ab73b8893d8331c35391175f/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1793050404","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351740/0afeaba26f2d480955a94a8f5ed3b5bb4bc5dfa9/ss_0afeaba26f2d480955a94a8f5ed3b5bb4bc5dfa9.600x338.jpg?t=1793050404","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351740/0afeaba26f2d480955a94a8f5ed3b5bb4bc5dfa9/ss_0afeaba26f2d480955a94a8f5ed3b5bb4bc5dfa9.jpg?t=1793050404"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351740/46f75e946546ae1593480b539a821d3d6f46d0fe/ss_46f75e946546ae1593480b539a821d3d6f46d0fe.600x338.jpg?t=179